      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202ca-f5ad-7679-bf0d-a52776f4aa8d -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Worker skips the final batch of fewer than 20 due jobs\n\nThe loop in `deliver_due` visits only full batches, leaving any final partial batch undelivered.\n\nWith 1\u201319 due jobs, `work` reports zero and delivers nothing.\n\nUse `len(jobs)` as the range stop so the final slice is processed.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202ca-5cdf-7416-91ae-a85085ed4b05/findings/01a202ca-f5b1-77df-8d29-b540e3dc6f26)"
